<title>AUSTRALIA: Network suspended,administrators appointed.</title>
<headline>Network suspended,administrators appointed.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in video publisher and distributor Network Entertainment Group Ltd were suspended from trading on Wednesday following the appointment of voluntary administrators, the Australian Stock Exchange said.</p>
</text>
